    <div class="section-head-center">
      <span class="section-tag">Find A Physician</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Board-Certified Clinical Specialists</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        Meet our distinguished physicians, read verified patient reviews, and schedule an in-person or virtual consultation.
      </p>
